Falsifies `rsext4::entries::verification::directory_block_walk_ends_inside_its_block`.

The defect: the block walk no longer checks that a record fits in what is left of the block, so
a record length past the end reads outside it.

Expected to fail: the slice index of the record.

diff --git a/src/entries/iterator.rs b/src/entries/iterator.rs
index e07e7af..075889b 100644
--- a/src/entries/iterator.rs
+++ b/src/entries/iterator.rs
@@ -77,7 +77,7 @@ impl<'a> Iterator for DirEntryIterator<'a> {
             }
 
             let rec_len = u16::from_le_bytes([remaining[4], remaining[5]]);
-            if rec_len < 8 || rec_len as usize > remaining.len() {
+            if rec_len < 8 {
                 return None;
             }
 
